{% set t = i18n[lang] %}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:760px">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-top:var(--space-4)">At Ecocruceros we respect your privacy. This policy explains what personal data we process when you contact us or book the tour, why, and how you can exercise your rights.</p>
    <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-top:var(--space-2)">Last updated: June 3, 2026.</p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-12)">1. Data controller</h2>
    <p>Ecocruceros, located at {{ site.location }}.<br>
    Email: <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> · WhatsApp: {{ site.whatsappDisplay }}.<br>
    <span class="pending">{{ t.pending }} — legal entity name and tax ID / RUC (A6).</span></p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">2. What data we collect</h2>
    <p>We only process the data you voluntarily provide when you message us on WhatsApp or by email to book or enquire, including:</p>
    <ul style="margin-top:var(--space-2);padding-left:var(--space-6)">
      <li>First and last name.</li>
      <li>Contact details (WhatsApp number and/or email).</li>
      <li>For the booking: number of passengers, ages, ID document and nationality.</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top:var(--space-3)">This website <strong>does not process online payments</strong> and <strong>does not collect browsing data for advertising or analytics</strong>.</p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">3. Purpose of processing</h2>
    <ul style="margin-top:var(--space-2);padding-left:var(--space-6)">
      <li>To manage and confirm your tour booking.</li>
      <li>To answer your enquiries.</li>
      <li>To meet the operational requirements of the tour, including those of the Reserve authority (SERNANP) where applicable.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">4. Legal basis</h2>
    <p>Processing is based on your consent and on the performance of the service agreement, in accordance with Peru's Law No. 29733 (Personal Data Protection Law) and its regulations.</p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">5. Third-party services</h2>
    <p>When you contact us via WhatsApp, your message is processed through WhatsApp/Meta under their own privacy policies. This site may also load Google Fonts and embedded YouTube videos, and is hosted by a hosting provider; each processes basic technical data (such as your IP address) under its own policies.</p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">6. Cookies</h2>
    <p>This site does not use tracking, advertising or analytics cookies. Only strictly necessary technical cookies may be used for the site to function.</p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">7. Data retention</h2>
    <p>We keep your data only as long as necessary to manage your booking and enquiries and to meet applicable legal obligations. After that it is deleted or anonymized.</p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">8. Sharing data</h2>
    <p>We do not sell your data. We only share the information strictly necessary to operate the tour and where required by law or a competent authority.</p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">9. Your rights</h2>
    <p>You may exercise your rights of access, rectification, cancellation and objection by writing to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>. You may also file a complaint with Peru's National Authority for the Protection of Personal Data.</p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">10. Security</h2>
    <p>We take reasonable measures to protect your data against unauthorized access, loss or misuse.</p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">11. Minors</h2>
    <p>Bookings that include minors are made by a responsible adult who provides their details with consent.</p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">12. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy. The current version will be published on this page with its update date.</p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">13. Contact</h2>
    <p>For any privacy enquiry: <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> · WhatsApp {{ site.whatsappDisplay }}.</p>

    <p style="margin-top:var(--space-8);color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:var(--fs-small)">This is a base draft and should be reviewed by a legal advisor before final publication.</p>
  </div>
</section>
